From 6abfa76e32e3aace60f6b1c28ff3805abd35649d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Khaled <khaledchoucri@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 18:30:11 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] POC-16f: show, don't tell - the game shows instead of
 explaining

- The Omega choice has no words: the Leader's lead Pokemon on a calm card and a red Omega
  (drawn: Gfx_DrawOmega); on the Omega the screen bleeds red and the ace growls. An Omega battle's
  banner is red with an Omega at each end.
- NET CHALLENGE: icons, a line of flavour, a clock, the best time. No counts, rules, rewards or
  unlock hints; locked entries are ?????; the Omega battles carry a red Omega.
- Rewards named only when won ("TIME 0:08.2", "GOT Shield!"). Battle, Custom screen and folder
  screens lose their explanatory lines; the new programs' texts are BN6's own.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FbWSqvcg6G5Gpw6ynvR5tJ
